<title>GERMANY: Siemens' Osram sees 96-97 sales up 3-4 pct.</title>
<headline>Siemens' Osram sees 96-97 sales up 3-4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osram GmbH, the lighting business of Germany's Siemens AG, said on Tuesday it expected a nominal sales rise of three to four percent and no change in profit in the 1996-97 business year.</p>
<p>The company, one of the world's top three lighting manufacturers, reported net profit rose 17 percent to 262 million marks for the 1995-96 year that ended September 30.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
